        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b153140-NqgZE0jSeIN4.jpg"
        },
        "description": "__Species:__ Wolf\n\nRanka behaves a lot like a dog/wolf, like protecting territory, food or chasing bones. When she is happy, she would wave her tail like a dog and can be easily won with food. She loves to act like a boss of a pack, but in reality she didn't have one and was desperate and willing to do anything in order to become friends with someone. Although she is a bit of an airhead, she is really kind and understands how awful it is to be alone.\n\n~!When she was young, she was saved by a boy from three bears. In reality the boy was beaten by them, but Ranka remembered it differently and since that was the first time someone of different specie protected her, she was happy and ever since then dreamed of forming a friendship and pack with different animals.!~",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": null
      },
      "voiceActors": [
