        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b153141-cbjCklmF0WMO.jpg"
        },
        "description": "__Species:__ Sloth\n\nSince Miyubi is a sloth, she is usually very slow and easily gets overheated or tired. She keeps some moss on her head, if she gets hungry. She is usually very quiet and not everyone can hear her. As she is a sloth, she doesn't really have friends and spends most of her time alone. When Ranka invited her in the club, she found some friends, which made her really happy.\n\n(Source: Murenase! Seton Gakuen Wiki)",
